Third-party content redistributed here
--------------------------------------

tests/fixtures/ruler_rows/ holds rows cached from RULER (Hsieh et al., 2024),
by way of the pre-generated mirrors simonjegou/ruler and
SaylorTwift/RULER-<length>-llama-3.2-tokenizer. They are kept so the blob
splitter test runs without network access. RULER is distributed by NVIDIA under
the Apache License 2.0, and its haystacks include Paul Graham's essays and
paragraphs from SQuAD and HotpotQA.

results/*/results.jsonl records the reference answers that RULER and LooGLE
ship with each item, alongside the generations produced here. LooGLE
(Li et al., 2024) is distributed by BIGAI under the Apache License 2.0.

Neither dataset is redistributed in full. Running the sweeps downloads them
from their own repositories.
